Z||000000||ThatRickGuy||01-31-2001||09:37 AM||||Hey, cruising into work this morning I ran into some problems. Riding along at about 75 down I-95, all of a sudden RPMs drop to 0. no spark. A semitruck was nice enough to point out the fact that my speed was dropping fast as I was trying to get off the road. But right before I hit the curb the engine kicked in again, RPMs back up to cruising like nothing was wrong. this happened probrably 8 times in a 30 minute drive (most of which was at highway speed, but also happened once while I was on the road to my office 25mph) It got new plugs, wire, dist cap, and rotor this fall for a tune up. So, any ideas what's left? Didn't ever get a check engine light, but I can double check it for codes. Anyways, thanks for any help.<P>-Rick||||reg||1
