Z||000004||ThatRickGuy||01-31-2001||10:26 AM||||they looked okay, and I would tend to think that a bad connection on the coil wire would be more sparatic, ocassional misses, or not fireing at all until you wiggled it. But this was full power then no spark the full power. I'm pretty sure it the Ignition module, but I was just wondering if anything else could cause a problem like this?||||reg||1
